{
  "epId": 5687,
  "name": "聖骸毒蠍",
  "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">亡骸遺毒 · 聖骸毒蠍</span></p><p>因為啃噬偉大的生命體而扭曲異變的毒蠍，操縱著險惡的轟雷。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/25/125391187/b95f744a2710b24cb940ab354c94b0fd_6086535035518910648.png",
